# chaRt: what a local run leaves behind. The shared rules are in the root .gitignore.
.Rhistory
Rplots.pdf
tests/*.out
# Pages the test helpers write when run by hand (tests/gallery.R, tests/live_gallery.R).
tests/gallery.html
tests/style_sheet.html
tests/live_gallery.html
# The saved replies of tests/llm_check.R's live calls (replies about the course files too); no test needs them.
tests/live_replies.rds
# The one invented-data reply check 7b-11 reads: committed, though the root .gitignore ignores *.rds.
!tests/reply_7b11.rds
